@maxhofmanngithub in general you can just swipe away the notification (swipe to the right). This will silence the alarm with the default snooze time.

On Android wear it will take a while until the notification is no longer restoreable. To speed this up, you can swipe it to the right to dismiss it. Then swipe up to get the restore dialog and swipe this one to the right as well.
It's a circular movement: right up right
